{"$defs": {"AttrRef": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "A typed reference to an attribute value (``{\"attr\": \"vit\"}``).", "properties": {"attr": {"not": {"pattern": "\\n"}, "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["attr"], "type": "object"}, "Attribute": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "One attribute declaration — a composition of orthogonal facets\n(bADR-0002). Its map key is the single id authority; the declaration carries\nno ``id`` field.", "properties": {"accepts": {"default": [], "items": {"enum": ["allocation", "effects"], "type": "string"}, "type": "array"}, "base": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/DirectBase"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/FormulaBase"}]}, "bounds": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/Bounds"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "category": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "domain": {"enum": ["number", "percentage", "probability"], "type": "string"}, "tier": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}}, "required": ["domain", "base"], "type": "object"}, "Attributes": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "The ``attributes`` section (bADR-0002): the tier vocabulary and the\nattribute declarations, each an id-keyed map.", "properties": {"items": {"additionalProperties": false, "patternProperties": {"^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$": {"$ref": "#/$defs/Attribute"}}, "propertyNames": {"not": {"pattern": "\\n"}}, "type": "object"}, "tiers": {"additionalProperties": false, "patternProperties": {"^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$": {"$ref": "#/$defs/Tier"}}, "propertyNames": {"not": {"pattern": "\\n"}}, "type": "object"}}, "type": "object"}, "BinaryOp": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "A binary operator applied as ``args[0] op args[1]`` (bADR-0003).", "properties": {"args": {"items": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/LiteralNode"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/AttrRef"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}, {"discriminator": {"mapping": {"add": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "ceil": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "divide": "#/$defs/BinaryOp", "floor": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "max": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "min": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "multiply": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "power": "#/$defs/BinaryOp", "round": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "subtract": "#/$defs/BinaryOp"}, "propertyName": "op"}, "oneOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/NaryOp"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/BinaryOp"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/UnaryOp"}]}]}, "maxItems": 2, "minItems": 2, "type": "array"}, "op": {"enum": ["subtract", "divide", "power"], "type": "string"}}, "required": ["op", "args"], "type": "object"}, "Bounds": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "Optional ``floor``/``cap`` clamps (bADR-0002).\n\nBoth sides are optional here; the *obligation* to declare bounds when the\ndomain is ``percentage``/``probability`` is a semantic rule (bADR-0004),\nnot a local shape constraint.", "properties": {"cap": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "floor": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}}, "type": "object"}, "DirectBase": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "A base declared as a direct scalar (``{\"direct\": 5}``).", "properties": {"direct": {"type": "number"}}, "required": ["direct"], "type": "object"}, "ExponentialForm": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "``coefficient · growth_rate^x`` under the ``power`` semantics\n(bADR-0003).", "properties": {"coefficient": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}]}, "form": {"const": "exponential", "type": "string"}, "growth_rate": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}]}, "input": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/AttrRef"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}]}}, "required": ["form", "input", "coefficient", "growth_rate"], "type": "object"}, "FormulaBase": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "A base declared as a formula (``{\"formula\": {…}}``).", "properties": {"formula": {"anyOf": [{"discriminator": {"mapping": {"exponential": "#/$defs/ExponentialForm", "linear": "#/$defs/LinearForm", "lookup_table": "#/$defs/LookupTableForm", "piecewise_linear": "#/$defs/PiecewiseLinearForm", "polynomial": "#/$defs/PolynomialForm"}, "propertyName": "form"}, "oneOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/LinearForm"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/PiecewiseLinearForm"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/PolynomialForm"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ExponentialForm"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/LookupTableForm"}]}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/LiteralNode"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/AttrRef"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}, {"discriminator": {"mapping": {"add": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "ceil": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "divide": "#/$defs/BinaryOp", "floor": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "max": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "min": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "multiply": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "power": "#/$defs/BinaryOp", "round": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "subtract": "#/$defs/BinaryOp"}, "propertyName": "op"}, "oneOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/NaryOp"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/BinaryOp"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/UnaryOp"}]}]}}, "required": ["formula"], "type": "object"}, "LinearForm": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "``base + per_point·x`` (bADR-0003).", "properties": {"base": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}]}, "form": {"const": "linear", "type": "string"}, "input": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/AttrRef"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}]}, "per_point": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}]}}, "required": ["form", "input", "base", "per_point"], "type": "object"}, "LiteralNode": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "A literal number leaf (``{\"literal\": 20}``).", "properties": {"literal": {"type": "number"}}, "required": ["literal"], "type": "object"}, "LookupTableForm": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "A step function: the ``y`` of the greatest table ``x ≤ input``; below\nthe first ``x`` takes the first ``y``. Never interpolates (bADR-0003).", "properties": {"form": {"const": "lookup_table", "type": "string"}, "input": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/AttrRef"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}]}, "table": {"items": {"maxItems": 2, "minItems": 2, "prefixItems": [{"type": "number"}, {"type": "number"}], "type": "array"}, "type": "array"}}, "required": ["form", "input", "table"], "type": "object"}, "Meta": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "Design identity (bADR-0001): the *document* names its game, the\n*toolkit* stays game-agnostic. ``name`` is the only required subfield.\n\nThe optional genre-lineage field lands with the templates issue (#505),\nnot here.", "properties": {"description": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "name": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["name"], "type": "object"}, "NaryOp": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "An n-ary operator (≥ 2 args), folded strictly left-to-right\n(bADR-0003).", "properties": {"args": {"items": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/LiteralNode"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/AttrRef"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}, {"discriminator": {"mapping": {"add": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "ceil": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "divide": "#/$defs/BinaryOp", "floor": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "max": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "min": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "multiply": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "power": "#/$defs/BinaryOp", "round": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "subtract": "#/$defs/BinaryOp"}, "propertyName": "op"}, "oneOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/NaryOp"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/BinaryOp"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/UnaryOp"}]}]}, "minItems": 2, "type": "array"}, "op": {"enum": ["add", "multiply", "min", "max"], "type": "string"}}, "required": ["op", "args"], "type": "object"}, "ParamRef": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "A typed reference to a declared parameter (``{\"param\": \"hp_per_vit\"}``).\n\nA parameter reference is the sole *tuning knob* form a scalar can take; a\nliteral is a deliberate non-knob (bADR-0003).", "properties": {"param": {"not": {"pattern": "\\n"}, "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["param"], "type": "object"}, "PiecewiseLinearForm": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "Linear interpolation between neighboring ``points``; inputs outside the\nrange clamp to the first/last ``y`` (bADR-0003).", "properties": {"form": {"const": "piecewise_linear", "type": "string"}, "input": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/AttrRef"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}]}, "points": {"items": {"maxItems": 2, "minItems": 2, "prefixItems": [{"type": "number"}, {"type": "number"}], "type": "array"}, "type": "array"}}, "required": ["form", "input", "points"], "type": "object"}, "PolynomialForm": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "``c0 + c1·x + … + cn·xⁿ``, coefficients in ascending degree\n(bADR-0003).", "properties": {"coefficients": {"items": {"type": "number"}, "type": "array"}, "form": {"const": "polynomial", "type": "string"}, "input": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/AttrRef"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}]}}, "required": ["form", "input", "coefficients"], "type": "object"}, "Tier": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "A tier is a **named facet pattern** a genre template groups attributes by\n(bADR-0002) — declared data, not schema law.\n\nA pattern may constrain any subset of ``domain``, ``base`` (by kind), and\n``accepts`` (by exact set equality); an omitted facet — ``None`` — is\n*unconstrained*, which is distinct from a present-and-empty ``accepts``\n(the pattern \"accepts exactly nothing\"). Pattern *satisfaction* is a\nsemantic rule (bADR-0004).", "properties": {"accepts": {"anyOf": [{"items": {"enum": ["allocation", "effects"], "type": "string"}, "type": "array"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "base": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["direct", "formula"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "domain": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["number", "percentage", "probability"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}}, "type": "object"}, "UnaryOp": {"additionalProperties": false, "description": "A unary operator (exactly one arg): ``floor``/``ceil``/``round``\n(bADR-0003).", "properties": {"args": {"items": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/LiteralNode"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/AttrRef"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/ParamRef"}, {"discriminator": {"mapping": {"add": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "ceil": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "divide": "#/$defs/BinaryOp", "floor": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "max": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "min": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "multiply": "#/$defs/NaryOp", "power": "#/$defs/BinaryOp", "round": "#/$defs/UnaryOp", "subtract": "#/$defs/BinaryOp"}, "propertyName": "op"}, "oneOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/NaryOp"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/BinaryOp"}, {"$ref": "#/$defs/UnaryOp"}]}]}, "maxItems": 1, "minItems": 1, "type": "array"}, "op": {"enum": ["floor", "ceil", "round"], "type": "string"}}, "required": ["op", "args"], "type": "object"}}, "$id": "urn:gda-balancing:standard-schema:1.0.0", "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema", "additionalProperties": false, "description": "The closed root envelope (bADR-0001).\n\n``schema_version`` is deliberately loose here — a plain string — because the\nfunnel's **preflight** phase owns the semver acceptance gate (bADR-0004);\nencoding a semver pattern here would fork that authority.\n\n``$schema`` is the optional bADR-0001 mirror: validated from parsed JSON via\nits alias, it points at the versioned structural schema ``$id`` so ecosystem\neditors get ambient validation; ``schema_version`` remains the single\nauthority ($schema-agreement is a semantic rule).\n\nThe six **reserved sections** — ``combat``/``encounters``/``builds``/\n``growth``/``economy``/``targets`` — are each declared ``Any`` and\n``exclude=True``. Declaring them keeps the generated structural schema and\npydantic construction **permissive** for these keys, so the *semantic* phase\ncan refuse a document using one with its dedicated ``reserved_section_present``\ncode and a precise pointer (bADR-0001, V12) — while a truly-unknown top-level\nkey still refuses *structurally* via the closed envelope. ``exclude=True``\nkeeps them out of every serialization, so canonical emission never\nmaterializes a reserved section.", "properties": {"$schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "attributes": {"$ref": "#/$defs/Attributes"}, "builds": {"default": null}, "combat": {"default": null}, "economy": {"default": null}, "encounters": {"default": null}, "growth": {"default": null}, "meta": {"$ref": "#/$defs/Meta"}, "parameters": {"additionalProperties": false, "patternProperties": {"^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$": {"type": "number"}}, "propertyNames": {"not": {"pattern": "\\n"}}, "type": "object"}, "schema_version": {"type": "string"}, "targets": {"default": null}}, "required": ["schema_version", "meta"], "type": "object"}
